Show a flash manifest (Qualcomm rawprogram*.xml or MediaTek scatter.txt) and check it against the image files actually present

Usage: android-doctor partitions [OPTIONS] <INPUT>

Arguments:
  <INPUT>  Directory holding rawprogram*.xml or scatter.txt, plus the images it references

Options:
      --no-color                   Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
      --sector-size <SECTOR_SIZE>  Bytes per sector (Qualcomm uses 4096; MediaTek varies by device) [default: 4096]
      --json                       Print JSON instead of text
  -h, --help                       Print help
